WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:02,210
Dad, Mom, I haven’t asked you yet

2
00:00:02,210 --> 00:00:04,210
When did you donate two buildings to the school?

3
00:00:04,210 --> 00:00:05,210
Aren’t my grades enough?

4
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:07,210
I'm not sure about this

5
00:00:07,210 --> 00:00:08,210
Ask your dad

6
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:10,210
Haha, don’t you know?

7
00:00:10,210 --> 00:00:12,210
Our company has always attached great importance to education.

8
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:14,210
I don’t even know how many primary schools have been built.

9
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:22,150
so much

10
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:25,540
Even if I just lie down, I can reach the third year

11
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:30,100
Wang Tianwei, you are capable, right?

12
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:31,100
Don't send me a single message

13
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:32,100
Want to sever the relationship between siblings

14
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:33,100
Who is in Qilin Military Academy?

15
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:34,100
You don’t even want to reply to text messages anymore

16
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,100
What's going on with King Zhao Yang?

17
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:36,100
He targets you

18
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:37,100
Let me know when you come out

19
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:38,100
We're done training

20
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,100
Exhausted. How are you doing there?

21
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:40,100
Are you still used to it?
